WEBVTT

00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:36.880
Left to face Tulpa alone. Ryo realizes Tulpa needs his armor, and that this battle is not going to be an easy one.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.500
Oh no!

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:38.060
Ah!

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:17.890
Mystic, Mr. O'Hara.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:21.300
However, you have prepared it for me.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:29.830
Of wildfire, you and the other ronin warriors helped me gain incredible power by...

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:35.240
My dark warlords I could not have succeeded without you

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:59.980
Sacrifice themselves while trying to save me they did everything they could been stronger. I could have saved them they died so

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.800
so I could live to finish this mission.

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:05.780
They were strong, which is why Talpa absorbed their armor.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.260
I promise not to let you down, Rowan.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:14.040
Kanto, Sai, Sage, I won't give up on my friends,

00:03:14.970 --> 00:03:16.340
no matter what.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:24.040
Astral of the wildfire, you are alone.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.440
It is now time for me to take your armor.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.980
That power will serve me well.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.740
This legend is true after all.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.270
Talpa has regained his physical form.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.710
Hey, where have the other guys gone, Mia?

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.670
The Ronin Warriors have lost.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.590
They were the one thing protecting the modern world.

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:54.050
And now, who knows what will happen with Talpa in full battle armor.

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:54.890
But how?

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.790
How could the Ronin Warriors lose to Talpa?

00:04:00.092 --> 00:04:00.732
I don't...

00:04:00.924 --> 00:04:01.524
Please it!

00:04:10.044 --> 00:04:14.344
destined to become part of my dark legacy, just like your friends.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:15.920
Not a chance, man.

00:04:16.156 --> 00:04:17.396
You're never going to take me.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.660
I want revenge for my friends!

00:04:21.148 --> 00:04:21.948
Bertie!

00:05:45.228 --> 00:05:46.688
You can harm me alone.

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.460
Do not deceive yourself.

00:05:48.876 --> 00:05:49.216
Thank you.

00:05:49.356 --> 00:05:52.036
Heaven power protects me, your friendship!

00:05:52.268 --> 00:05:53.108
I betrayed you.

00:06:00.764 --> 00:06:01.384
Through them.

00:06:01.628 --> 00:06:07.168
I will possess ultimate power, and you will live forever as a part of me.

00:06:07.804 --> 00:06:12.984
Prepare yourself, Ryle. You will now live to serve my evil dynasty.

00:06:13.820 --> 00:06:15.420
I'll never serve you.

00:06:16.636 --> 00:06:17.016
Uh-huh.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.830
My friends! They're alive!

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:37.740
I have to fight for them!

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:44.220
Your friends remain as foolish as you are.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:49.260
think they can resist me even while I have complete control over them.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:49.740
What?

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.370
Do not allow your hopes to rise.

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:59.970
As soon as I absorb you and your armor, all of you will become part of my body, my...

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.100
Holy Spirit, I am ready to claim you now.

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:08.170
They're alive then. I've got to find a way to free them.

00:07:08.940 --> 00:07:11.300
How can I kill Tulpa and not kill them?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.990
I have to figure out something.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:18.470
There's got to be a way to fight him and still save my friends.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.290
Can't lose this.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:07.410
Longfire, could it be you realize you're no match for me?

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.990
Are you afraid to try to save your friends?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:14.570
I thought you would want to be a hero and save the world from my control.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.540
How'd it be a way to kill him and still save the others?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.580
I've got to think, what can I do?

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:34.870
There's nothing left for you, Ryo of the Wildfire.

00:08:35.070 --> 00:08:37.170
Give up and become a part of me.

00:08:37.430 --> 00:08:40.590
If you do, you will be reunited with your friends.

00:08:42.100 --> 00:08:43.740
I'm not stupid, Tulpa.

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:44.920
I know that's a lie.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.740
So what do you believe in?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:49.290
Yourself?

00:08:58.060 --> 00:08:59.680
Why do you resist me?

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:03.920
You are ready to become a part of my dark power!

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.640
What? What's happening?

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:15.060
I was toying with you, but walk away.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:19.380
Join me, become part of me!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.890
Sir, the power devours the sea.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:13.040
The fear and hatred of humans feeds me.

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:17.880
Soon, my power will spread throughout the world.

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.870
That's it. I remember now.

00:10:22.320 --> 00:10:24.760
Tulpa's power comes from the people he's captured.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:27.080
It's their fear that feeds his power.

00:10:27.740 --> 00:10:29.740
The more people that Tulpa captures,

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:32.380
the more powerful his armor will become.

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.450
The people's fear is what feeds Talpa,

00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:36.570
then that means...

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:37.740
Yuli!

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.680
Do you know what that means?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.960
It means that your parents are definitely still alive.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:44.020
Really?

00:10:44.560 --> 00:10:44.800
Yes.

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.260
Talpa has used the fear of the people to make them prisoners.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.370
Their energy has turned him into a giant.

00:10:51.690 --> 00:10:52.870
He must be stopped.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:55.250
You gotta destroy him, Ryu,

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.070
and get back my mom and dad.

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:12.700
I do my best to get them back, Uli, but my friends are inside of them, and I need their help.

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.930
But how am I going to set them free?

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.170
I don't know what to do.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.620
The Warriors will return.

00:11:24.740 --> 00:11:25.180
Warriors.

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.730
Resume the wildfire.

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:29.850
Worry for yourself.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:36.480
first the others are gone you can fight with all your power but you will never destroy me

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:29.550
Until I've killed you first, Tulpa!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:40.860
problem was if you destroy me your friends will die along with me without your armor i do not

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:47.500
possess all the power i need i will not be denied i always get what i want

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.160
I have a place in my dynasty.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.640
My armor will never abate you.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:07.020
I will prove you wrong.

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.190
Good job, boy. You pulled it off.

00:13:44.070 --> 00:13:46.470
Think you can outsmart me?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:09.010
What I will do? If I kill Toppo, my friends will die. But if I don't, he will destroy the world!

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:17.740
I will not save you or your friends, Wildfire.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:23.640
Besides, I have that power inside of me and I can use it against you!

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:25.820
What?

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:35.950
Control, witness my newest army, the army of your former friends.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.290
What did that mean?

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.710
I'm a little strata.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.240
I'm a little strata.

00:15:15.960 --> 00:15:23.490
I'll get it!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:28.380
That was the wildfire surprise does not create you!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.520
Here, look!

00:16:30.924 --> 00:16:33.604
Boy, how about this?!

00:17:30.732 --> 00:17:31.232
Why?

00:17:46.508 --> 00:17:47.068
Serious.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.680
I had no idea Talpa's power was this strong.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.780
It's not.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:52.380
No, Yuli.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.780
You're only going to make things worse than they already are.

00:17:56.684 --> 00:17:57.044
Here!

00:17:57.516 --> 00:17:57.856
Right.

00:17:58.156 --> 00:17:58.876
It's my help.

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:19.320
I apologize that I must use the power of your friends to destroy you, but your armor will serve me well. You will become a part of me.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:38.400
Is this it? The end of my fight against Tulpa?

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:44.980
What was the point to fight so hard and so-

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:54.280
Still losing friends, Rowan, Kento, Sai, and Sage.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.800
I'm sorry I couldn't save you.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.610
I'll be with you soon.

00:19:02.012 --> 00:19:02.932
What did you...

00:19:21.596 --> 00:19:24.576
Somehow I feel that my power is returning to me.

00:19:26.428 --> 00:19:27.188
It can't be!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:20.860
Make no doubt about it!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.200
Save and kill, Tom!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:29.970
SHOT!

00:20:33.196 --> 00:20:36.156
Stop it! Stop it now! Please!

00:20:36.356 --> 00:20:40.216
What are you waiting for, man? We're banging on your power to pull this off!

00:21:00.444 --> 00:21:01.204
I won't.

00:21:02.876 --> 00:21:04.876
Destroy Topla if it kills you!

00:21:04.876 --> 00:21:06.836
Don't make me please!

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.520
So

00:22:12.988 --> 00:22:14.908
with his Rodan armor to defeat Topa.

00:22:15.004 --> 00:22:17.544
Because he risked killing his friends in the process.

00:22:18.524 --> 00:22:22.804
The Ronin Power is the only thing that will stop Togba's evil takeover.

00:22:23.612 --> 00:22:27.692
Can the Ronin Warriors defend the human world from inside Tulpa's evil armor?

00:22:28.892 --> 00:22:29.812
and they stop him.

00:22:30.380 --> 00:22:33.420
Ryo and the Ronin Warriors are locked in a fight.

00:22:33.804 --> 00:22:34.984
Against fate.

00:22:39.372 --> 00:22:40.012
So far.
